# engine/hooks.patch: hooks into the pinned ScummVM Drascula engine.
#
# Applied by scripts/build-engine.sh with `git apply` against vendor/scummvm.
# The work lives in engine/a11y.cpp and a11y.h; these hunks only construct the
# A11yLayer and call into it, each call guarded on _a11y so the engine runs
# unchanged without a layer. Lines starting with `#` above the first `diff` are
# comments and are ignored by git apply.
#
#   drascula.h     friend class A11yLayer (read-only access to the text and
#                  room-action tables) and an A11yLayer *_a11y member.
#   drascula.cpp   construct the layer at the top of runCurrentChapter(); skip
#                  the chapter 1 intro; onStartup() once the first room is live;
#                  `if (_a11y.poll()) return true;` once per main-loop frame, so
#                  a command that ends the chapter ends it the way a door click
#                  does; onUpdateEvents() at the end of updateEvents(), the one
#                  pump that runs inside speech and cutscene loops (for `skip`).
#   graphics.cpp   onText() at the top of centerText(), the single chokepoint
#                  every on-screen line passes through.
#   converse.cpp   onConverseBegin/Frame/End around the modal conversation
#                  loop, where poll() never runs.
#   animation.cpp  onGameEnd() in animation_9_6(), before the credits.
